# This machine has core.autocrlf=true. Without forcing LF here, a Windows
# checkout of docker-entrypoint.sh would get CRLF line endings, and
# `#!/bin/sh` on CRLF fails inside the Linux container the backend image
# runs in (a `$'\r': command not found`-style error) — the exact kind of
# "works on my machine, breaks on the next clone" bug Docker packaging is
# supposed to eliminate.
* text=auto
docker-entrypoint.sh text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
